{{- if and (eq .chezmoi.os "linux") (eq (includeTemplate "is-root" . | trim) "true") (or (eq .chezmoi.osRelease.id "fedora") (eq .chezmoi.osRelease.id "almalinux")) -}}
{{- $machineClass := includeTemplate "machine-class" . | trim -}}
{{- $dnfPackages := .packages.dnf.common -}}
{{- if eq $machineClass "desktop" -}}
{{-   $dnfPackages = concat $dnfPackages .packages.dnf.desktop -}}
{{- else -}}
{{-   $dnfPackages = concat $dnfPackages .packages.dnf.server -}}
{{- end -}}
{{- $distributionPackages := index .packages.dnf.distributions .chezmoi.osRelease.id -}}
{{- if eq $machineClass "desktop" -}}
{{-   $dnfPackages = concat $dnfPackages $distributionPackages.desktop -}}
{{- else -}}
{{-   $dnfPackages = concat $dnfPackages $distributionPackages.server -}}
{{- end -}}
{{- $dnfPackages = $dnfPackages | uniq | sortAlpha -}}
#! /usr/bin/env bash
{{ includeTemplate "scripts-library" . }}

# Re-run whenever the manifest or the resolved profile changes.
# dnf manifest sha256: {{ .packages.dnf | toJson | sha256sum }}
# machine_class: {{ $machineClass }}
# os_release_id: {{ .chezmoi.osRelease.id }}

packages=(
{{- range $dnfPackages }}
  {{ . | quote }}
{{- end }}
)

log_task "Installing {{ len $dnfPackages }} dnf packages for the '{{ $machineClass }}' profile on {{ .chezmoi.osRelease.id }}"
sudo dnf install --yes "${packages[@]}"
sudo localectl set-locale LANG={{ .locale.primary | shellQuote }} || \
  log_manual_action "Could not set primary locale {{ .locale.primary }}"
{{- end -}}
